## What Did NOT Work / corrections

- **First E10 scan undercounted renders** — used `VID-shot%` but real file_type is lowercase
  `VID-shot-ss-s15-...`; the `rendered` Set keys were lowercase, plan codes uppercase → all falsely
  showed "no-vid". CORRECTED: **all 8 infected shots ARE rendered, all in REVIEW status, two-anchor.**
- **Inline tsx duration bug**: Seedance rejects `duration:'3'` (min '4', enum 'auto'/'4'..'15') → 422
  surfaced as instant COMPLETED + "no video.url". Fixed by clamping to '4'. (The prod provider clamps;
  my inline script forgot to.)
- **cwd drift**: git commands `cd /c/SandyStudio` reset cwd to root → later inline tsx failed to find
  `@supabase`. Always `cd /c/SandyStudio/webapp &&` before inline tsx.
- Inline tsx emits benign `uv async.c` assertion on teardown (exit 9) — data prints fine; grep it out.

