## EXACT NEXT STEPS (B then C — Director chose this sequence)

### C SCOPE (corrected) — 8 infected shots, ALL rendered REVIEW + two-anchor:
**SH03, SH07, SH10, SH12, SH14, SH17, SH18, SH23.** Fix = regenerate ref-only (~$10-15, 8 renders).
They're REVIEW (not APPROVED/LOCKED) → clean to replace. SH07+SH03 already visually validated ref-only
in the smoke. Legit two-anchor (non-orbit, LEAVE): SH02, SH04, SH06, SH13, SH19.

### B — build the regenerate-mode surfaces (Director's explicit ask; also the TOOL that fixes C):
Anti-additive — the backend ALREADY supports it; only surface it in 2 places:
- **Backend ready:** `webapp/app/api/assets/[id]/regenerate-video/route.ts` already accepts
  `provider` (seedance-standard = ref / seedance-with-end-image = two-anchor) + `end_image_asset_id`.
  "Regenerate ref-only" = provider=seedance-standard, end_image=null.
- **B1 GUI toggle:** in the regenerate drawer — control «🔗 два якоря / 🎯 только реф» instead of the
  raw provider text field. File: `webapp/components/preview/ShotPlanContract.tsx` (provider field ~line 178-189)
  and/or the VGEN regenerate panel (`VGENShotPanel.tsx` / `ProviderControlPanel.tsx`).
- **B2 Polina tool:** PA function e.g. `regenerate_shot(shotId, anchor_mode)` → hits the same
  regenerate-video route. So Director can verbally tell Polina «перегенери SH07 без якорей». PA tools
  live in the concierge tool registry (search `webapp/lib/concierge/` + PA tool definitions).
- **fail-loud:** «ref-only» nulls end_image (safe). «two-anchor» needs an end frame — if none, surface
  «нет end-якоря для этого шота», NEVER silent-degrade.

**Then C = use B** to flip the 8 to ref-only (by Director/Polina, or a one-off script driving the route).

### Director's decision log this session
- Slice 3 (FORMAT per-shot) = PARKED (low value; refs YAGNI, video plan-path self-covers).
- Redefined work = anchor-mode (orbit⇒ref) doctrine + regenerate surfaces.
- Sequence: A (done) → B (build) → C (fix 8 with B). Chose to /save+/clear+/resume fresh for B+C
